      "notes": "ColabDesign resolves AF2_DIR/params/params_<model>.npz first and AF2_DIR/params_<model>.npz second, and upstream download_startup.sh extracts the archive flat into AF2_DIR. The canonical localized tree is therefore the flat sixteen-entry set; AF2_DIR must never name the tar. The archive is 11,429 bytes larger than the tree it contains because tar block padding and headers are not runtime content."
